                       * init "dlaw_HI_exp.ini"                                                          *
                       * table SED "QSO_masking.sed"                                                     *
                       * nuL(nu) = 43 at 1 Ryd                                                           *
                       * turbulence 1.0 km/s                                                             *
                       * stop temperature off                                                            *
                       * stop column density 24.0                                                        *
                       * save last radius ".rad"                                                         *
                       * save last continuum ".cont"                                                     *
                       * save last physical conditions ".phy"                                            *
